# A store into a fresh object that nothing reads again may be dropped.
# With the fault injected (testing=AssumeCalleesRetainNothing), the code that retained the object would read 1 instead of 101, and no value check covers that read.
# The cell is overwritten when make() returns, so that code crashes when it next accesses the cell.
